Provenance of the FXAA pass (runtime/core/shaders/fxaa.comp and its C
reference runtime/core/tests/fxaa_ref.c)

Both port the FXAA 3.11 Quality pixel shader (the FXAA_PC path, preset 39)
of FXAA3_11.h, "NVIDIA FXAA 3.11 by TIMOTHY LOTTES", as NVIDIA published it
in its GameWorks graphics samples (samples/es3-kepler/FXAA/FXAA3_11.h, SDK
version 3.00; SHA-256 of the file
ad82e2c292fa9ad91b8ad89dd5407f626766bcf3647b93556940353524b198c6): the
compute pass to GLSL for the core picture pipeline, the reference to C on
the CPU. The arithmetic and the preset's search steps are the shader's; the
files' headers say what differs (pixel units, luma from the color, the
search as one loop).

